jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/6b53c666-4e8c-45a9-b37d-bb5d4c3d3c1a/IMG_0414.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/6b53c666-4e8c-45a9-b37d-bb5d4c3d3c1a/IMG_0414.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/6b53c666-4e8c-45a9-b37d-bb5d4c3d3c1a/IMG_0414.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/6b53c666-4e8c-45a9-b37d-bb5d4c3d3c1a/IMG_0414.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/6b53c666-4e8c-45a9-b37d-bb5d4c3d3c1a/IMG_0414.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/6b53c666-4e8c-45a9-b37d-bb5d4c3d3c1a/IMG_0414.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      \n        \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f8bd5acd-1ac3-4c8d-b614-9a3ef9efaba7/IMG_0323.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        \n      \n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          \n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p><strong>from </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/marseille\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>marseille</strong></a><strong> | visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a><strong> | more </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>visual art</strong></a></p>","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"8c846101658cb2cde9295c22de6bd9ebd54dad88adca046fbff09285489435f3","category":"Sites"}